    "test_name": "test_minicpmo_4_5_omni_duplex_eval",
    "description": "CUDA nightly full-duplex C8 replay of the 120 Qwen3-aligned PR_correction IDs with the question mix, then VL judging. Prefix cache stays off on the duplex deploy. The job records the correction success rate without a numeric floor: completed==120, every session judged, and mean_all_success finite in [0, 1]. Dataset revision matches the Qwen3-Omni pin. Performance baselines start empty until a measured H100/B200 window is collected.",
